  "referenceNumber": "RUS2066",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that Yulia GURYEVA-MOTLOKHOV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following grounds: Yulia GURYEVA-MOTLOKHOV is associated with a person who has been involved in obtaining a benefit from the Government of Russia, namely Andrey Grigoryevich Guryev; and, GURYEVA-MOTLOKHOV is associated with a person who has been involved in obtaining a benefit from the Government of Russia, namely Andrey Andreevich Guryev. \n",
